| mode | original values | pushes | pops | emitted | discarded duplicates | peak fronts |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| ordinary | 8 | 8 | 8 | 8 | 0 | 3 |
| union | 8 | 8 | 8 | 3 | 5 | 3 |

| empty outer result size | all-empty result size |
| ---: | ---: |
| 0 | 0 |
\image(figures/k_way_merge_union.svg)
// result_end
\caption(Actual output decisions show which consumed duplicate identities are suppressed.)
